## Technology

ImageToolsPro is built as a browser-based web application using modern web technologies.

The tools are designed to provide fast image processing while keeping the user's files on their device.

## Why ImageToolsPro?

ImageToolsPro focuses on simple image-processing tasks that can be completed directly in the browser.

The tools are designed to be:

- Free to use
- Simple and easy to understand
- Fast for common image tasks
- Privacy-focused
- Useful on desktop and mobile devices

No account is required for the basic image tools.
